  Nodes:
  - NodeID: Start
    SpeakerName: Lan (Street Food Vendor)
    Text: "This town is so quiet, it\u2019s like people have forgotten how to spend
      money."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 1
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 1
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: "It\u2019s a peaceful place, Lan. Isn't that what everyone wants?"
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 2
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 3
    SpeakerName: Lan (Street Food Vendor)
    Text: Peace doesn't pay my taxes! I need noise, I need crowds, I need people
      who are actually hungry for something other than gossip.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 4
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 4
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: Maybe you should move to the big cities then.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 5
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 5
    SpeakerName: Lan (Street Food Vendor)
    Text: And pay five times the rent? No thanks. I'll stay here and complain, it's
      cheaper.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
